# The prebuilt ChromaDB vector store (~1.7 GB of embeddings over 300k
# complaints). Far past GitHub's file-size limits — rebuild it locally with the
# ingest script rather than committing it. See README.
# Leading slash matters: it anchors to the repo root so app/data/playbooks/
# (the trusted-source corpora, which MUST be committed) is not swept up too.
/data/

# Artefacts of scripts/record_preview.py. The video is meant to be uploaded to
# GitHub's CDN (see README) rather than committed, since only CDN-hosted files
# render as a player.
preview.mp4
preview.webm
preview-failure.png
videos/
